  Training Mode:  This will let you
familiarize yourself with the game and
its controls.  Starting off on level
one of the chosen game, you will be
allowed to fly through the first four
waves of that game.  After completing
these you will again be placed at wave
one, this time on Rookie difficulty.
You will start from scratch again,
with no money and only your machine
guns.
